{
  "id": "liLjKrwqH1fur3Ap",
  "name": "D3-WF-C1: WhatsApp Receiver",
  "description": null,
  "active": true,
  "activeVersionId": "dc1e5864-ac5d-43d7-99b5-e546fb319ccc",
  "createdAt": "2026-05-19T14:39:10.380Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-08-16T19:11:58.915Z",
  "isArchived": false,
  "versionCounter": 14,
  "sourceWorkflowId": null,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "c1-sticky1",
      "name": "📋 WF-C1 Overview",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        280,
        40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-C1: WhatsApp Receiver — Twilio Inbound Gateway\n\nReceives inbound WhatsApp messages from Twilio, responds 200 immediately (onReceived), then async-fires message to WF-C2 (Claude Core).\n\n**Twilio POST body fields:**\n- `From`: \"whatsapp:+44XXXXXXXXXX\" → stripped to \"+44XXXXXXXXXX\" (E.164)\n- `Body`: raw message text\n- `To`: business WhatsApp number\n\n**Flow:** Twilio POST → Webhook (200 immediately) → ⚙️ Config → Normalize Phone → Forward to Claude Core\n\n⚠️ BEFORE ACTIVATION:\n1. Set `wfC2WebhookUrl` in ⚙️ Client Config to your n8n webhook URL (e.g. https://your-n8n.cloud/webhook/whatsapp-core)\n2. Point Twilio WhatsApp sandbox/number inbound webhook to this workflow's URL\n3. Twilio credentials needed in WF-C4 (Send Reply) — not this workflow",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 940
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-webhook",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        300,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "whatsapp-in",
        "responseMode": "onReceived",
        "responseData": "noData",
        "options": {}
      },
      "webhookId": "4680e789-00d1-43c2-85fc-16eb2cd364fe",
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-config",
      "name": "⚙️ Client Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        540,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "c1-cfg-01",
              "name": "wfC2WebhookUrl",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "https://YOUR_N8N_HOST/webhook/whatsapp-core"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-normalize",
      "name": "Normalize Phone",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        780,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "try {\n  var body = $('Webhook').first().json.body || {};\n  var rawFrom = body.From || '';\n  var messageBody = body.Body || '';\n  var numMedia = parseInt(body.NumMedia || '0', 10);\n  var phone = rawFrom.replace(/^whatsapp:/i, '').trim();\n  if (phone && !phone.startsWith('+')) { phone = '+' + phone; }\n  if (!phone) {\n    return [{ json: { phone: '', message: messageBody, numMedia: numMedia, error: 'Missing From field', skip: true } }];\n  }\n  return [{ json: { phone: phone, message: messageBody, numMedia: numMedia, rawFrom: rawFrom, skip: false } }];\n} catch (e) {\n  return [{ json: { phone: '', message: '', numMedia: 0, error: e.message, skip: true } }];\n}"
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-if-text",
      "name": "Has Text Content?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1020,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1-cond-msg",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.message }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "c1-cond-skip",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.skip }}",
              "rightValue": true,
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "notEquals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-forward",
      "name": "Forward to Claude Core",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1260,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('⚙️ Client Config').first().json.wfC2WebhookUrl }}",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ phone: $json.phone, message: $json.message }) }}",
        "options": {},
        "genericAuthType": "httpHeaderAuth"
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "retryOnFail": false,
      "credentials": {
        "httpHeaderAuth": {
          "id": "CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "D3 Internal — C1 to C2 header key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-media-fallback",
      "name": "Build Media Fallback",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1260,
        580
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "try {\n  var phone = $json.phone || '';\n  var numMedia = $json.numMedia || 0;\n  var message;\n  if (numMedia > 0) {\n    message = \"I can only read text messages. Please type your question and I'll be happy to help!\";\n  } else {\n    message = \"I didn't receive any text in your message. Please type your question and I'll be happy to help!\";\n  }\n  return [{ json: { message: message, phone: phone } }];\n} catch (e) {\n  return [{ json: { message: \"Please type your question and I'll be happy to help!\", phone: '' } }];\n}"
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "c1-send-media",
      "name": "Call Send Reply - Media",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1500,
        580
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "4s8DGFmrZxpX46Dd"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "id": "78785303-0220-430d-9589-95de1b09f850",
      "name": "Valid Sender?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        900,
        440
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 2,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1-valid-sender",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.skip === true || !$json.phone ? 'no' : 'yes' }}",
              "rightValue": "yes",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        }
      },
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    }
  ],
